.TH WMGLYPH 1 "2026" "Window Maker"
.SH NAME
wmglyph \- lightweight Unicode glyph selector
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wmglyph
[\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wmglyph
is an emoji-picker-style Unicode character browser. A search field and a
category (Unicode block) dropdown filter a scrollable, painted glyph grid.
Clicking a glyph copies its UTF-8 encoding to both the
.B PRIMARY
and
.B CLIPBOARD
X selections, so it can be pasted elsewhere with middle-click or the
clipboard paste key of the target application.
.PP
The character and block data is derived from the
Unicode Character Database files
.IR UnicodeData.txt " and " Blocks.txt
files. See the
.B FILES
section for the license notice covering those tables.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display a short usage summary and exit. The short
.B \-h
alias is also accepted.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version information and exit. The short
.B \-v
alias is also accepted.
.SH USAGE
The window is laid out, top to bottom, as:
.IP \(bu 2
a search field that filters characters by name (case-insensitive substring);
.IP \(bu 2
a category dropdown listing the Unicode blocks;
.IP \(bu 2
a scrollable grid of glyphs for the current block or search result;
.IP \(bu 2
a status bar showing the selected character's block, code point, glyph and name;
.PP
The grid shows at most one page of rows at a time. When a search matches
more characters than fit on one page,
.B Prev
and
.B Next
buttons beside the status bar page through the result set, and the status
bar shows which slice is displayed.
.PP
Click a cell to select it and copy the character. The mouse wheel scrolls
the grid. Combining marks are shown on a dotted circle for display only, but
only the mark itself is copied, so it attaches to whatever base character
follows the cursor.
.PP
Legacy requestors asking for
.BR XA_STRING " receive Latin-1 text when the selected character is in"
Latin-1 and a conversion failure otherwise. The character is always
available as UTF-8 via
.BR UTF8_STRING .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DISPLAY
X display to use.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I wmglyph\-data/UNICODE\-LICENSE
copy of the Unicode License v3 covering the derived character and block
tables compiled into
.BR wmglyph .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wmaker (1),
.BR wxcopy (1),
.BR wxpaste (1)
.SH AUTHOR
